    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39383" root="نجد" body-key="n">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجدهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked,</i> or <i>desired, of him aid,</i>
or <i>assistance,</i> (S, L, K, *) <i>and succour.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجد</span> <i>He</i> (a man) <i>became strong after having
been weak,</i> (S, L, K,) or <i>sick.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجد</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span>, (S, L,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span>, (L, TA,) <i>He became emboldened against him,</i> (S, L, K,) <i>and clave to
him,</i> (L,) <i>after having regarded him with awe,</i>
or <i>fear.</i> (S, L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجد</span> <i>He became
courageous after having been cowardly.</i> (A.)
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجُدَ</span>.

